=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  logforward not-read ------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Decided: no Figma frame. web-01.example.net runs Ubuntu 24.04,$
# whose logger is rsyslog. An action in 50-remote.conf does not$
# close: the row is Unknown, and the item refuses with words.$
$
# Syslog Settings ##############################################$
$
  [?] Syslog               Unknown ~ can't read$
$
  Forwarding ---------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Logger               rsyslog$
  [?] Server               Unknown$
   -  hardn.yml            192.0.2.50:514 TCP$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Set servers          Can't read rsyslog's settings$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-1 or q]:$
$
$

